{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.BraidKnot.AJFigureEightCertificate","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJFigureEightCertificate","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic"],"declarations":1,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.BraidKnot.AJFigureEightCertificate.feCert_local_identity_cleared","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.BraidKnot.AJFigureEightCertificate.feCert_local_identity_cleared","kind":"theorem","line":40,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/5697c3130d79ead793a58c1a0a984a2e49b1365f/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/BraidKnot/AJFigureEightCertificate.lean#L40-L78","doc":"**Local telescoping identity (certificate relation), cleared form,\nproved**: `nL·dR = nR·dL` — equivalent to\n`a₂r₂ + a₁r₁ + a₀ = Cert(x,qy)s − Cert(x,y)` wherever the\ndenominators are nonzero. ","signatureChunk":0}]}